{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":22.350000381469727,"text":"When this fresco was found, it was restored as a boy picking saffron flowers in a meadow. Years later, more fragments turned up and showed something else. The creature did not have human hands, but paws, and it was blue. It is a monkey. That story is the best example of how archaeology works. An explanation stands until new evidence arrives.","words":[{"word":"When","start":0,"end":0.5},{"word":"this","start":0.5,"end":0.7599999904632568},{"word":"fresco","start":0.7599999904632568,"end":1.0399999618530273},{"word":"was","start":1.0399999618530273,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"found","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"it","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.0199999809265137},{"word":"was","start":2.0199999809265137,"end":2.359999895095825},{"word":"restored","start":2.359999895095825,"end":2.5799999237060547},{"word":"as","start":2.5799999237060547,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"a","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3.2799999713897705},{"word":"boy","start":3.2799999713897705,"end":3.2799999713897705},{"word":"picking","start":3.2799999713897705,"end":3.6600000858306885},{"word":"saffron","start":3.6600000858306885,"end":4.099999904632568},{"word":"flowers","start":4.099999904632568,"end":4.5},{"word":"in","start":4.5,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"a","start":4.699999809265137,"end":5.019999980926514},{"word":"meadow","start":5.019999980926514,"end":5.019999980926514},{"word":"Years","start":5.78000020980835,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"later","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.320000171661377},{"word":"more","start":6.539999961853027,"end":6.760000228881836},{"word":"fragments","start":6.760000228881836,"end":7.079999923706055},{"word":"turned","start":7.079999923706055,"end":7.380000114440918},{"word":"up","start":7.380000114440918,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"and","start":7.659999847412109,"end":7.960000038146973},{"word":"showed","start":7.9